# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production mode) — see TILES_BASE_URL
# in src/config/regions.ts. Local dev is unaffected: `npm run dev` doesn't
# load this file, so it still falls back to the local Flask server (:5000).
#
# Relative, not the bucket's absolute URL: index.html, assets/, data/,
# tiles/, and tiles_nochm/ all get uploaded together as siblings under one
# arbitrary bucket path (see vite.config.ts base) — "." keeps every fetch
# (and the pmtiles:// source, which resolves the same way under the hood)
# relative to wherever that path ends up being.
VITE_TILES_BASE_URL=.
